summary.label:
Focus on retail warehouse management, minimalist invoicing, and assist in managing warehouse commodity information. Say goodbye to manual bookkeeping and improve work efficiency.
The main functions include the management of the goods in and out of the warehouse, the management of the cash register bills, and the statistics of the purchase, sales and inventory data.

No complex redundant functions, no login registration advertisements, no background data collection.

*Warehouse treasure, providing convenience for retail warehouse management;
*Add scan code storage, storage function, faster
* New product specifications, more professional management of clothing products;
* New sales relationship, more convenient management of suppliers and customers;
*Statistics module adds the function of querying data by year and month, more specific;
*New measurement unit, quantity/weight can be switched at will, more intimate;
*Add fresh food management, expire reminder, more versatile;
* Added the function of editing high-definition large images of commodities, check the commodities for more details
*Export statistical data to Excel table, reconcile, view, share, more simple;
*Import inventory data Excel table, one-step storage, super surprise;
*The cash register function is online, making it easier to collect, keep and check accounts;
* Added iCloud data synchronization function, please maintain good backup habits;
*Add S/N code storage management of electronic and electrical products;
*Operation is more concise and smoother, dedicated to becoming a lightweight APP.


Any questions about the retail warehouse treasure can be added to the developer email: 1154236089@qq.com Let me help you solve the problem. I have been collecting user needs, you can see my version update records, I have been quietly insisting on making it better! Give it a chance, I will give you a high-efficiency warehouse management tool!


